window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>In my world, I take what I want. Even her.</b></p> <p>I'm her godfather. I shouldn't be pushing her down to her knees and making use of that sassy mouth, let alone tearing her clothes off, belting her bare ass, and then ravaging her virgin body as she screams my name.</p> <p>But I'll do all of that and much more as I teach her what it means to belong to a man like me.</p> <p>Because I can.</p> <p>Because she's mine.</p> <p>Mine <i>is a standalone novel, which is the first book in Sara's bestselling series, The Godfathers. It includes spankings and rough, intense sexual scenes.</i></p>"; 
